:''Not to be confused with [[Bustin' Ghosts (Removed Combo)|Bustin' Ghosts]].''
'''Bustin' Phantoms''' (妖怪バスターズ！, ''Yōkai Basutāzu!'', '''Yokai Busters!''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Research Power UP (Sm): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 26 frames (0.87 sec).

