==Trivia==
*Bustin' Phantoms' Japanese name, Yokai Busters!, may be a reference to the game ''[[wikia:yokaiwatch:Yo-kai Watch Blasters (video game)|Yo-Kai Watch Busters]]'', also known as ''Yo-Kai Watch Blasters'' outside of Japan. It could also be a reference to the film ''[[wikipedia:Ghostbusters|Ghostbusters]]''.

